  "notes": "{硬|かた}い is an i-adjective meaning hard, stiff, or rigid.\n\nFORMS:\n- {硬|かた}くない: not hard\n- {硬|かた}くて: hard and...\n- {硬|かた}かった: was hard\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {硬|かた}い: physically hard (stone, meat)\n- ⟦{堅|かた}い→堅い：18753_katai⟧: firm, reliable, solid (person, plan)\n- ⟦{固|かた}い→固い：12090_katai⟧: tight, stuck (knot, lid)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {硬|かた}い⟦{石|いし}→石：02177_ishi⟧: hard stone\n- ⟦{体|からだ}→体：00784_karada⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{硬|かた}い: inflexible body\n- ⟦{表情|ひょうじょう}→表情：03585_hyoujou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{硬|かた}い: stiff expression\n- ⟦{頭|あたま}→頭：00574_atama⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{硬|かた}い: inflexible thinking\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n⟦{柔|やわ}らかい→柔らかい：01096_yawarakai⟧: soft, flexible",
